.el .ds Aq '
.TH garuda-toolbox-settings-set 1  "garuda-toolbox 6.3.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-settings\-set \- Change one setting. The window takes it at its next start
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox settings set\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> <\fIVALUE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change one setting. The window takes it at its next start
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
language: A language code such as `de`, or `system`
.IP \(bu 2
start\-at\-login: Open the window at login: on or off
.IP \(bu 2
update\-check: Minutes between update checks (5 to 1440), or `never`
.IP \(bu 2
user\-services: The Services page opens on your own services: on or off
.IP \(bu 2
copy\-reports: Copy a finished report and an upload\*(Aqs link: on or off
.IP \(bu 2
aur: The Packages page lists the AUR, downloaded once a day: on or off
.IP \(bu 2
log\-level: How much the log file holds: error, warn, info, debug, trace
.IP \(bu 2
dark\-scheme: The colours of the dark theme: a dark colour scheme such as `nord`, or `system` for the desktop\*(Aqs
.IP \(bu 2
light\-scheme: The colours of the light theme: a light colour scheme such as `catppuccin\-latte`, or `system` for the desktop\*(Aqs
.RE
.TP
<\fIVALUE\fR>
The new value, see `settings set \-\-help`
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  garuda\-toolbox settings set language de
  garuda\-toolbox settings set update\-check 60
  garuda\-toolbox settings set start\-at\-login on
  garuda\-toolbox settings set dark\-scheme nord
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox\-settings(1), garuda\-toolbox(1)
